[h1]HWMP Patch 2.4.1 - Field Test[/h1]
Shared fixes and original four races for Homeworld Remastered, based on the complete Players Patch 2.3Test build21.
Use this standalone package by itself; do not add another Players Patch.

Workshop release is a field-test candidate.

[h2]2.4.1 maintenance update[/h2]
Removed two stock-identical model copies (Hiigaran mothership and Vaygr Medium missile HODs). Both corvette HOD copies remain because shared loading would replace their distinct impact sounds. Native missile launch/impact checks passed; gameplay coefficients are unchanged. The local main BIG is about 28 MB smaller. Technical filenames stay stable.

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Owner-safe gravity wells, including tested new save/load cases; original permissions/speed are preserved.
[*] Support-frigate cargo recovery, per-ship capture/self-destruct permissions and independent stalled-docking timers.
[*] Refreshed Taiidan missile-defense selections and restored Vaygr Medium missile weapon-fire binding.
[*] Accepted Hgn/Vgr6/6 starting collectors and the Assault Frigate's final speed-accuracy node4 to1.2. Other broad balance coefficients are preserved.
[*] Native build/research tooltip translations for English, French, German, Italian, Spanish and Russian.
[/list]

[h2]Playtesting needed[/h2]
[list]
[*] Two-client MP synchronization;
[*] normal/2x starts and languages;
[*] visible squadron repair;
[*] paid UI hyperspace/cancel and Guard return;
[*] full Hiigaran versus Vaygr matches with side/map swaps.
[/list]

Report release hashes and reproduction steps.

Old active-well saves made before the new journal are not guaranteed.
Specific engine tests do not certify all campaigns or saved transport states.

